{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっほー⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日甘栗の殻を手で割ってたら手を切りました⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジミに痛いやつです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて切りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気をつけないとー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベリが私の部屋にくるときいっつもアオコ持ってくるのだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本踏んでるか、寝転がってつぶしてるか、放り投げてあるかなんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回部屋に持ってくるから大切なんだろうな～⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前話しかけたら、｢むちょ｣って言われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ˙-˙ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は欅って、書けない?ですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日だけは夜更かしして見てください⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも仕事とか学校とかあると思うので録画してみてください⸜ ( ˆ࿀ˆ ) ⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなか"}],"source":"archive"}